&lt;h3 class=&quot;separator&quot;&gt;Expert en survie (Ext)&lt;a class=&quot;headeranchor&quot; id=&quot;Expert_en_survie_Ext_34&quot; href=&quot;#Expert_en_survie_Ext_34&quot; title=&quot;Link to this Section&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Un roublard disposant de ce talent ajoute &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Premiers-Secours.html&quot; title=&quot;Premiers secours&quot;&gt;Premiers secours&lt;/a&gt; et &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Survie.html&quot; title=&quot;Survie&quot;&gt;Survie&lt;/a&gt; &#224; la liste de ses comp&#233;tences de classe.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des joueurs - R&#232;gles avanc&#233;es (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
